ever and embraces her new life.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872340/screencap/6aae91e962e0c.jpg"}]},{"id":7764,"path":"/anime/7764-now-that-i-can-control-reality-with-a-mouse-cursor-im-gonna-click-away-on-the-girls","info":{"title":"Now That I Can Control Reality With A Mouse Cursor, I'm Gonna Click Away On The Girls!","synopsis":"Takumi è uno studente introverso, appassionato di computer e con poca fiducia in sé stesso, soprattutto quando si tratta di rapportarsi con le ragazze. A scuola si sente invisibile e prova un sentimento non ricambiato per Mone, una compagna dal carattere forte e spesso provocatorio. Un giorno, però, la sua vita cambia drasticamente: Takumi scopre che il cursore del mouse del suo computer può uscire dallo schermo e interagire con la realtà, permettendogli di \"cliccare\" su oggetti e persone come se il mondo fosse un'interfaccia digitale. Questo potere è visibile solo a lui e apre a possibilità tanto assurde quanto tentatrici. All'inizio Takumi usa questa abilità in modo impulsivo, tra curiosità e scherzi, soprattutto nei confronti di Mone, ritrovandosi coinvolto in situazioni imbarazzanti e fuori controllo. Con il tempo, però, il confine tra gioco e conseguenze reali diventa sempre più sottile, costringendolo a riflettere su ciò che desidera davvero e su come usare (o non usare) il suo potere.","image":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/473125/posters/6abbb5efaf075.jpg","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/473125/posters/6abbb5efaf075.jpg","background":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/473125/posters/6abbb5efaf075.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2zhlC9mffas"],"imdbId":"","type":"series","tags":["TV","In Corso","Autunno","2026"],"tagKeys":{"TV":"TV","In Corso":"Ongoing","Autunno":"Autumn"},"genres":["Ecchi","Romance","Supernatural"],"rating":"6.7","studio":"Suiseisha","episodesCount":4,"extra":{"ids":{"malId":63381,"anilistId":206774,"crunchyId":null,"disneyId":null,"netflixId":null,"primeId":null,"anilistIds":[206774],"malIds":[63381],"anidbIds":[19858],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[473125]},"stats":{"scoreRaw":"6.65","favorites":79,"members":391,"views":48686,"episodesCountRaw":4,"episodesLength":6},"flags":{"dub":0,"alwaysHome":1},"meta":{"day":"Indeterminato","season":"Autunno","status":"In Corso","type":"TV","createdAt":"2026-09-14 18:24:49","userId":2},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:206774","mal:63381"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19858","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"206774"},{"provider":"mal","id":"63381"},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"473125","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-8":"1-8","1-2":"1-2"}}]},"artworkSources":{"logo":"provider","poster":"tvdb"},"artworkCandidates":{"logo":[],"poster":[{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/473125/posters/6abbb5efaf075.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx206774-s1a2BAAifoUD.png"}],"background":[]}},"related":[],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-4","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":4},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"7764|1|4"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"The Strange Mouse Cursor","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"473125","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"110100","synopsis":"During IT class, Takumi notices that his mouse cursor has sprung out of the screen. He asks his childhood friend Mone, who's sitting next to him, if she can see it, but she can't and just makes fun of him… Assuming she can't see it, Takumi slips the cursor into the gap in Mone's clothes and starts clicking on her body! As he continues clicking on Mone, who's writhing in pleasure from this unfamiliar sensation, the words \"The Real Deal\" eventually appear in the right-click menu… Huh? \"The Real Deal\", is that what I think it is?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11576655/screencap/6ab9935ca9143.jpg"},{"title":"Error: Insufficient Click Point","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"473125","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"110558","synopsis":"As a result of continuously clicking on Mone in the nurse's office, the unthinkable happens with \"The Real Deal\" appearing in the right-click menu! Takumi instinctively clicks it, but what appeared next was a strange error message reading, \"Insufficient click points.\" His dream of \"The Real Deal\" ends in failure… On top of that, the possibility suddenly arose that Kaoru, a mysterious girl in his class, might have witnessed the whole thing! Driven by anxiety, Takumi tails Kaoru—but what awaited him was an unexpected turn of events?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018845/screencap/6acbb41947ea7.jpg"},{"title":"Cut and Paste","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"473125","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"110754","synopsis":"The 'Real Deal' feature finally activates! Pushed down by Kaoru, who had become even more aggressive than before, Takumi finds himself drowning in pleasure. The next day, faced with Mone's usual bossy attitude, Takumi launches another click attack! But her tie is in the way, preventing him from moving the cursor inside her clothes. Takumi selects 'Cut' for the tie from the right-click menu, but… Called over by a suspicious Mone, Takumi ends up treating her injury by chance. However, he was in for a surprise!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018846/screencap/6ad4f098a0757.jpg"},{"title":"Episode 4","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"4"},"episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"473125","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"110877","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12018847/screencap/6ade2a8a17f11.jpg"}]}]}
